, "ec00009w": {"type":"text","parent":"ec00009k","order":"a2","name":"Most map users are not exploring. They …","w":{"mode":"fill"},"content":"Most map users are not exploring. They are late, on a phone with 9% battery, and need the next turn. Hana walks through three years of research on stressed navigation, the features her team removed, and the one they had to put back.","grow":"fixed-width","style":{"typography":{"$ref":"type/body"}},"fill":{"$ref":"color/muted"}}

